<title>USA: US corn gluten feed prices steady, demand improves.</title>
<headline>US corn gluten feed prices steady, demand improves.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten feed prices were steady, with some dealers reporting improved demand. High soymeal prices have some feedmixers replacing soymeal with corn gluten, they said.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
